      "_nPostCount": 0,
      "_sInitialVisibility": "show",
      "_bHasFiles": false,
      "_sText": "<p><s>I've decided to go with a single version now, glasses only. It's my final ideal look of the mod so there won't be other variations</s>. Scratch that I decide to include a no glasses version again since it's the final iteration of the mod. Plus, it could open up mod merging for those that know how to that. Like combining a hair mod into this.</p><p>I gave up on getting rid of the purple glow, so I worked it into the outfit by adding a pendant there</p><p>I replaced Lucia's book with another book</p>",
      "_bShowRipePromo": false,
